PROPOSED — NOT APPLIED.

This patch targets `prospective_pair/should_run_base.py`, which lives in the
repository-root worktree (branch `data-refresh-2026`), OUTSIDE this node's write
scope. It is recorded here for the coordinator; node O11 has not modified it.
The logic it describes is implemented and tested in this directory as
`gate_logic.classify_fixed` (45 checks, all passing — see TESTS.py).

Behavioural contract of the change:
  * a slate row with no official game_id is no longer dropped; it is served under
    the SAME provisional id `daily_forecast.py:562` already mints for it;
  * every decline names the number of games examined and every unresolved game,
    so a decline can never again be silent;
  * `current_label`, `CONTRACT_LABELS`, `LEAD` and the `and not dup` conjunction
    are untouched. The last of those is defect D-c / node O12.

